{
  "info": {
    "name": "CostumeCloset Theatre",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for CostumeCloset Theatre.\n\nTest Execution Order for Mandatory Tests:\n1. Run ALL folders in order from top to bottom.\n2. The Mandatory Assignment Tests folder MUST run last and in sequence.",
